<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE - Grootvlei Q2 pre-capex loss deepens.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Grootvlei Q2 pre-capex loss deepens.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-June versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss before capital spending   29.16 vs 1.50</p>
<p>    Capital spending			 10.58 vs 4.76</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)			   464 vs 577</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled/treated		116,000 vs 107,000</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)			     4.0 vs 5.39</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)			  73,280 vs 56,432</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)		     49,664 vs 51,854</p>
<p>Full name: The Grootvlei Proprietary Mines Ltd, managed by Randgold and Exploration Co Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE -</p>
